WEBVTT

01:38.289 --> 01:41.050
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.080 --> 01:43.979
[Episode 10]

01:48.530 --> 01:49.090
My Lady.

01:51.229 --> 01:52.000
My Lady.

01:53.000 --> 01:53.840
Do you think Physician Jiu

01:53.870 --> 01:55.229
will be angry with us?

01:57.840 --> 01:58.560
What do you think?

02:03.230 --> 02:03.950
Then will he

02:03.950 --> 02:05.400
refuse to help us save Master?

02:06.640 --> 02:08.430
Didn't you say he's lazy

02:08.430 --> 02:10.410
and doesn't really care about us

02:10.470 --> 02:12.080
and that Master Kongtongzi

02:12.080 --> 02:13.360
is the real expert?

02:14.110 --> 02:16.240
I did think so before,

02:16.750 --> 02:18.560
but after thinking about it,

02:19.150 --> 02:20.400
we've never actually seen

02:20.420 --> 02:21.730
Master Kongtongzi's skills.

02:22.400 --> 02:23.240
But Physician Jiu

02:23.240 --> 02:24.680
has proven he can truly fight demons.

02:25.890 --> 02:27.290
We dropped a sure bet

02:27.740 --> 02:29.470
without finding a better one.

02:30.030 --> 02:31.070
Feels like a big loss, doesn't it?

02:34.480 --> 02:35.270
Don't worry.

02:36.220 --> 02:37.800
That sure bet isn't going anywhere.

02:40.960 --> 02:41.840
Almost done, right?

02:45.430 --> 02:45.960
Take a look.

02:46.030 --> 02:46.560
Look, look.

02:46.650 --> 02:47.900
I just discovered this one.

02:48.150 --> 02:48.840
How is it?

02:49.360 --> 02:50.240
Thank you, Physician Jiu.

02:50.570 --> 02:51.250
I'll be off now.

02:52.590 --> 02:54.950
"A great physician who's kind-hearted and skilled."

02:55.470 --> 02:56.630
Someone gave that to you?

02:57.800 --> 02:58.630
What are you doing here?

03:00.030 --> 03:01.130
I'm here to dye your hair.

03:02.240 --> 03:02.710
No need.

03:04.520 --> 03:05.360
Why?

03:05.800 --> 03:07.430
Didn't you ask someone else for help?

03:07.800 --> 03:09.030
Why are you still trying to curry favor with me?

03:11.120 --> 03:12.190
It was all a misunderstanding.

03:12.990 --> 03:14.430
I went there

03:14.460 --> 03:16.210
to expose that fraud.

03:18.840 --> 03:20.840
Did I ever tell you

03:21.310 --> 03:22.560
that after my dad resigned from his post,

03:22.560 --> 03:23.840
he took me away from Guangping,

03:23.840 --> 03:24.800
and we moved to Yuanzhou?

03:25.590 --> 03:26.280
In Yuanzhou,

03:26.280 --> 03:27.710
I ran a wine shop.

03:28.210 --> 03:29.930
At first, I sold pine flower wine

03:29.960 --> 03:30.840
and amber wine,

03:31.370 --> 03:32.370
but for a long time,

03:32.400 --> 03:33.870
business stayed low.

03:34.190 --> 03:35.750
After some digging, we found out

03:36.120 --> 03:37.120
Yuanzhou already had sellers

03:37.140 --> 03:38.790
for those two kinds of wine,

03:39.070 --> 03:40.590
but they ruined the reputation

03:40.630 --> 03:42.030
of those two wines

03:42.940 --> 03:44.500
by selling low-quality stuff for profit.

03:45.140 --> 03:46.260
In the end,

03:46.430 --> 03:47.180
my dad and I

03:47.210 --> 03:48.540
had to sell other kinds of wine instead.

03:49.470 --> 03:50.630
You get it now, don't you?

03:51.310 --> 03:52.800
No matter how skilled you are,

03:53.180 --> 03:54.260
you still can't stop

03:54.400 --> 03:55.400
greedy peers from

03:55.430 --> 03:56.910
ruining the industry's reputation.

03:57.960 --> 03:59.560
You work so hard every day,

03:59.670 --> 04:01.240
risking your life to catch demons,

04:01.710 --> 04:03.050
but those frauds out there

04:03.080 --> 04:04.750
are stepping on your name

04:04.750 --> 04:05.600
to climb higher.

04:05.630 --> 04:06.630
Aren't you mad?

04:10.080 --> 04:11.030
It makes you mad?

04:11.520 --> 04:12.310
Of course.

04:12.520 --> 04:13.400
I'm mad.

04:14.400 --> 04:15.710
I'm your friend, after all.

04:17.110 --> 04:18.230
So what did you do?

04:21.560 --> 04:24.080
I went to investigate.

04:24.820 --> 04:25.890
I figured once I spotted

04:25.920 --> 04:27.240
his flaws,

04:27.270 --> 04:28.240
I'd expose him.

04:35.890 --> 04:36.540
Xuanye.

04:36.920 --> 04:37.630
Xuanye.

04:44.430 --> 04:45.159
It took me

04:45.180 --> 04:46.370
four hours

04:46.400 --> 04:47.360
to prepare these black beans.

04:48.150 --> 04:50.070
If you don't use them, they'll go to waste.

04:54.480 --> 04:55.310
Come. Sit down.

04:55.760 --> 04:56.280
What are you doing?

04:56.310 --> 04:56.920
Sit, sit.

05:07.160 --> 05:07.910
My dad said

05:08.360 --> 05:09.590
white hair makes people

05:09.720 --> 05:10.950
look tired and worn out.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.630
What did Kongtongzi say?

05:19.310 --> 05:20.190
He said…

05:20.830 --> 05:22.350
something really bad is going to happen to me,

05:22.760 --> 05:23.570
but if I use

05:23.600 --> 05:24.830
his magic tool,

05:25.120 --> 05:26.560
I'll be safe from harm

05:27.040 --> 05:28.120
and danger.

05:29.310 --> 05:30.190
You gave him money?

05:35.120 --> 05:36.070
Just a small amount.

05:40.600 --> 05:42.130
I already sent Chi Xue out

05:42.150 --> 05:43.680
to track down that life-swapping demon.

05:44.830 --> 05:45.560
Once I've

05:45.940 --> 05:46.850
given my word,

05:46.870 --> 05:47.790
I never go back on it.

05:48.630 --> 05:50.000
I have my own way of doing things.

05:51.040 --> 05:52.159
Since you've chosen me,

05:52.430 --> 05:53.360
you have to trust me.

05:54.659 --> 05:55.980
I do trust you.

05:57.120 --> 05:58.090
Then wait patiently.

05:58.560 --> 05:59.190
Don't rush.

05:59.909 --> 06:01.670
And stop looking for help elsewhere.

06:04.480 --> 06:05.390
U-Understood.

06:23.180 --> 06:26.430
♫When you're in love, your smile is like the spring breeze♫

06:27.060 --> 06:30.220
♫Walking beside me, bathed in moonlight♫

06:29.120 --> 06:30.120
Where is it?

06:30.920 --> 06:34.430
♫No need for words, I already feel it♫

06:34.460 --> 06:37.990
♫Dark hair like ink, time stretches on♫

06:38.520 --> 06:41.900
♫When you're in love, you wish this love could last forever♫

06:42.310 --> 06:45.240
♫Leaning in close to whisper softly♫

06:45.500 --> 06:47.830
♫I miss you♫

06:48.070 --> 06:49.940
♫On every moonlit night♫

06:50.040 --> 06:54.320
♫Tenderness ties us together♫

06:52.480 --> 06:53.360
Sorry.

06:55.570 --> 06:59.320
♫Let me take your hand and keep our promise♫

06:59.320 --> 07:00.050
Here it is.

06:59.580 --> 07:02.820
♫You shake my soul and pull at my heartstrings♫

07:03.400 --> 07:05.270
♫If I think this world is beautiful♫

07:05.300 --> 07:07.020
♫It's partly because of the moon♫

07:07.160 --> 07:10.630
♫And mostly because I met you♫

07:11.120 --> 07:14.580
♫When life gets hard♫

07:15.070 --> 07:18.150
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

07:18.690 --> 07:20.540
♫This lingering love♫

07:20.560 --> 07:22.560
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

07:22.580 --> 07:25.270
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

07:25.370 --> 07:28.020
♫Right by my side♫

07:41.700 --> 07:45.080
♫When you're in love, your smile is like the spring breeze♫

07:45.650 --> 07:48.880
♫Walking beside me, bathed in moonlight♫

07:49.400 --> 07:52.950
♫No need for words, I already feel it♫

07:53.250 --> 07:56.380
♫Dark hair like ink, time stretches on♫

07:57.010 --> 08:00.440
♫When you're in love, you wish this love could last forever♫

08:00.720 --> 08:03.700
♫Leaning in close to whisper softly♫

08:04.040 --> 08:06.450
♫I miss you♫

08:06.600 --> 08:08.210
♫On every moonlit night♫

08:08.490 --> 08:12.960
♫Tenderness ties us together♫

08:11.560 --> 08:13.070
Why is it dripping everywhere?

08:14.060 --> 08:17.850
♫Let me take your hand and keep our promise♫

08:18.050 --> 08:21.390
♫You shake my soul and pull at my heartstrings♫

08:21.920 --> 08:23.840
♫If I think this world is beautiful♫

08:23.870 --> 08:25.650
♫It's partly because of the moon♫

08:25.670 --> 08:28.930
♫And mostly because I met you♫

08:29.490 --> 08:33.020
♫When life gets hard♫

08:29.600 --> 08:30.950
Let me wipe it for you.

08:33.370 --> 08:36.650
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

08:37.220 --> 08:39.110
♫This lingering love♫

08:39.130 --> 08:41.039
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

08:41.059 --> 08:43.740
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

08:43.919 --> 08:46.410
♫Right by my side♫

08:46.150 --> 08:46.960
I'll do it myself.

09:05.630 --> 09:06.360
Xuanye.

09:15.840 --> 09:16.960
What were you two doing?

09:17.200 --> 09:18.110
Why were you lying on his lap?

09:21.080 --> 09:23.000
I was dyeing Xuanye's hair.

09:26.360 --> 09:27.360
Dyeing his hair?

09:30.030 --> 09:30.630
My Lady.

09:31.330 --> 09:32.570
Physician Jiu is not angry anymore?

09:36.080 --> 09:37.830
Physician Jiu is more reliable.

09:38.270 --> 09:39.750
From now on, let's listen to him

09:40.080 --> 09:41.000
and wait patiently for news.

09:41.480 --> 09:42.600
No more fussing around.

10:03.070 --> 10:03.840
Leave here!

10:14.720 --> 10:15.320
Tingzhou.

10:16.630 --> 10:17.400
Do you think

10:17.620 --> 10:18.930
Xuanye

10:18.960 --> 10:19.870
could be Manying?

10:20.320 --> 10:20.910
What?

10:22.510 --> 10:23.750
You don't remember Manying?

10:24.270 --> 10:25.510
I do.

10:25.980 --> 10:27.460
Wasn't that someone you saw in a dream?

10:29.130 --> 10:29.770
Yes.

10:30.200 --> 10:32.080
Back then, you all said I was sick,

10:32.320 --> 10:33.870
that there couldn't be demons in this world,

10:34.120 --> 10:35.550
and it was just a dream.

10:36.080 --> 10:37.080
But now it's been proven

10:37.110 --> 10:38.350
that there are demons in this world.

10:38.930 --> 10:39.970
So is it possible

10:40.000 --> 10:41.050
that what I said was real

10:41.080 --> 10:42.200
and Manying was real too?

10:42.320 --> 10:42.870
Alright, alright.

10:43.400 --> 10:44.160
It was all real.

10:44.960 --> 10:47.270
But even if that dream was real

10:47.580 --> 10:48.670
and Manying was real,

10:49.810 --> 10:50.640
how do you know

10:50.670 --> 10:51.980
Physician Jiu is Manying?

11:01.770 --> 11:02.650
Xuanye

11:03.360 --> 11:05.630
has a wound this big

11:06.280 --> 11:08.000
right over his left chest.

11:08.100 --> 11:09.580
And it's a through-and-through wound,

11:09.640 --> 11:11.090
exactly where Manying

11:11.120 --> 11:12.200
was wounded back then.

11:13.140 --> 11:13.930
My Lady.

11:16.080 --> 11:18.840
You took off Physician Jiu's clothes?

11:23.720 --> 11:25.110
That's not the point.

11:25.240 --> 11:26.240
My... My Lady.

11:26.240 --> 11:27.900
You're engaged.

11:28.670 --> 11:29.700
How could you just

11:29.720 --> 11:30.990
take off a strange man's clothes?

11:31.360 --> 11:32.480
How is Xuanye

11:32.510 --> 11:33.790
a strange man?

11:34.100 --> 11:35.540
We're quite close.

11:35.860 --> 11:36.460
But you still

11:36.490 --> 11:38.040
shouldn't have taken off his clothes.

11:38.720 --> 11:40.270
I didn't mean to.

11:41.760 --> 11:42.430
My Lady.

11:43.120 --> 11:44.360
I know you don't like

11:44.360 --> 11:45.320
Young Master Li,

11:45.930 --> 11:47.770
but this match was arranged by Master.

11:48.540 --> 11:49.650
Before you properly

11:49.670 --> 11:50.710
settle this matter,

11:51.120 --> 11:52.440
even if you've fallen for someone else,

11:52.440 --> 11:53.210
you can only keep it

11:53.240 --> 11:54.240
quietly in your heart.

11:55.080 --> 11:56.630
How could you take off his clothes?

11:57.030 --> 11:58.440
I told you I didn't mean to.

11:58.480 --> 11:59.360
You know exactly

11:59.360 --> 12:00.390
whether you did or not.

12:00.840 --> 12:02.200
Anyway, I'll keep an eye on you

12:02.200 --> 12:03.080
on behalf of Master.

12:06.910 --> 12:07.840
Who's the one giving orders here?

12:08.390 --> 12:09.550
Who's the one giving orders here?

12:09.550 --> 12:10.480
I'll keep an eye on you!

12:10.480 --> 12:11.520
Just take your stuff and go.

12:11.550 --> 12:12.080
I'm leaving.

12:12.120 --> 12:13.030
My Lady, stop dreaming.

12:41.000 --> 12:41.870
Snap out of it.

12:42.960 --> 12:43.840
Snap out of it.

12:55.080 --> 12:55.630
Xuanye.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.200
I've got news about the life-swapping demon.

12:59.210 --> 12:59.880
Tell me about it.

13:00.750 --> 13:02.870
There was a guy who rode his horse recklessly

13:03.410 --> 13:04.050
and killed someone.

13:04.080 --> 13:05.200
Lord Geng had him beheaded.

13:05.390 --> 13:06.190
You know about this, right?

13:06.620 --> 13:07.340
Yes, I do.

13:08.200 --> 13:09.080
But word is,

13:09.460 --> 13:10.260
he didn't die.

13:12.900 --> 13:13.470
He didn't die?

13:13.600 --> 13:14.240
That's right.

13:14.670 --> 13:15.870
Someone saw him leaving the city,

13:16.080 --> 13:17.240
and they seemed really sure.

13:18.270 --> 13:19.480
The government office has already sent people

13:19.480 --> 13:20.080
to track him down in secret.

13:20.980 --> 13:21.550
Think about it.

13:22.150 --> 13:22.840
How could an ordinary person

13:22.860 --> 13:23.770
come back from the dead?

13:24.510 --> 13:25.000
Perhaps,

13:25.000 --> 13:26.270
just like Banxia's dad,

13:26.390 --> 13:27.510
his life was swapped by the demon.

13:27.870 --> 13:28.390
Right?

13:37.250 --> 13:38.770
My Lady, something happened!

13:39.080 --> 13:41.030
What happened? Why the panic?

13:41.840 --> 13:42.840
That Master Kongtongzi

13:42.870 --> 13:43.910
we met yesterday—

13:43.910 --> 13:44.790
he's dead.

13:46.000 --> 13:46.910
Dead?

13:48.150 --> 13:49.390
I passed by while buying groceries

13:49.390 --> 13:50.630
and saw mourning banners at his house.

13:50.830 --> 13:52.120
I asked around and found out that

13:52.960 --> 13:55.030
he got up to pee last night, tripped,

13:55.440 --> 13:56.550
and died just like that.

13:57.120 --> 13:58.000
How strange!

13:58.910 --> 14:00.270
He was wielding swords and spears yesterday,

14:00.300 --> 14:01.300
looking like a seasoned fighter.

14:01.970 --> 14:03.660
Yet he died from falling when going to pee at night.

14:04.550 --> 14:07.440
Miss, what do you mean by "the bird doesn't fly?"

14:09.240 --> 14:10.480
Isn't it right here?

14:26.290 --> 14:26.930
What's the matter, Xuanye?

14:27.090 --> 14:27.880
We're busy here.

14:28.300 --> 14:29.570
I just need

14:29.600 --> 14:30.390
to ask you something.

14:31.610 --> 14:32.770
That reckless noble who rode a horse

14:32.840 --> 14:34.120
and ran someone over in the street—

14:34.480 --> 14:35.670
did he really come back to life?

14:36.700 --> 14:37.650
You've heard about it too?

14:40.300 --> 14:40.890
What do you mean?

14:43.530 --> 14:44.170
A few days ago,

14:44.190 --> 14:45.240
he was beheaded.

14:45.480 --> 14:45.960
But these past few days,

14:45.960 --> 14:47.150
there have been rumors that he's not dead.

14:47.200 --> 14:48.240
We're not taking it seriously.

14:48.480 --> 14:49.600
Only Youhuang is,

14:49.670 --> 14:50.630
and he's out looking into it.

14:51.720 --> 14:52.720
There's no smoke without fire.

14:53.790 --> 14:54.320
Well...

14:54.480 --> 14:56.200
could there really be

14:56.490 --> 14:57.800
a way to bring the dead back?

14:58.630 --> 14:59.960
Maybe it's not resurrection.

15:00.710 --> 15:02.320
It's very possible that the one you beheaded

15:02.600 --> 15:03.670
wasn't him at all.

15:04.200 --> 15:05.080
That's impossible.

15:05.270 --> 15:06.390
I verified his identity myself.

15:06.550 --> 15:07.120
Alright,

15:07.360 --> 15:08.150
go back for now.

15:08.630 --> 15:09.900
If anything else comes up,

15:10.030 --> 15:10.870
let me know right away.

15:16.270 --> 15:17.200
The white crow.

15:17.720 --> 15:19.480
When the white crow appears, someone dies.

15:19.850 --> 15:20.610
The white crow…

15:21.000 --> 15:21.480
Banxia.

15:21.870 --> 15:22.750
Why are you in such a hurry?

15:23.840 --> 15:24.440
Where are you going?

15:31.650 --> 15:32.440
The white crow.

15:36.550 --> 15:38.000
There's a white crow above your head.

15:50.340 --> 15:51.260
Xuanye.

15:51.740 --> 15:53.460
Did you find anything?

15:59.790 --> 16:00.390
Banxia.

16:00.840 --> 16:01.720
Is that crow…

16:02.150 --> 16:02.960
Is Master Crow

16:03.590 --> 16:04.320
still here?

16:07.930 --> 16:08.520
No?

16:15.080 --> 16:15.750
Xuanye,

16:16.180 --> 16:18.500
am I really going to die?

16:19.810 --> 16:20.420
I…

16:23.840 --> 16:27.120
If Yama wants you dead at midnight…

16:27.120 --> 16:27.990
Shut up!

16:28.150 --> 16:29.360
Shut up! Shut up!

16:29.390 --> 16:30.320
Stop fooling around.

16:31.740 --> 16:32.740
You scared the crap out of me.

16:35.360 --> 16:36.570
But I don't get it.

16:36.730 --> 16:38.210
Why does someone die

16:38.240 --> 16:39.270
every time the white crow appears?

16:40.180 --> 16:41.900
That day in Chi Wangchuan's illusion,

16:42.440 --> 16:43.520
he sent the white crow

16:43.550 --> 16:44.320
to attack us.

16:45.210 --> 16:45.880
I thought at the time

16:45.910 --> 16:47.080
it was just some spell of his,

16:47.840 --> 16:48.790
but I didn't expect

16:49.390 --> 16:50.240
the white crow

16:50.920 --> 16:52.440
to be his companion demon.

16:53.120 --> 16:53.630
Well,

16:53.750 --> 16:55.050
that doesn't make sense!

16:55.690 --> 16:57.210
I've never had bad blood

16:57.240 --> 16:59.000
with Master Chi Wangchuan.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.670
If he's after anyone, it should be you.

17:00.720 --> 17:02.720
Why me?

17:02.960 --> 17:05.050
The white crow is just a spiritual creature.

17:05.200 --> 17:06.349
It doesn't have the power to kill people.

17:06.960 --> 17:08.400
What do you mean?

17:09.200 --> 17:10.160
I mean,

17:10.440 --> 17:11.440
death is the cause,

17:11.640 --> 17:12.640
and the white crow is the effect.

17:13.050 --> 17:14.500
It's appeared because your days

17:14.520 --> 17:15.430
are numbered.

17:16.109 --> 17:17.589
It's not because of its appearance

17:17.790 --> 17:18.829
that you will die.

17:19.880 --> 17:21.680
So when the white crow appears,

17:22.069 --> 17:23.550
it only signals death.

17:23.550 --> 17:24.880
It doesn't bring death.

17:26.680 --> 17:27.310
That's right.

17:28.240 --> 17:30.110
But that still doesn't make sense!

17:30.930 --> 17:31.770
Isn't this just like

17:32.240 --> 17:33.590
her eyes that can

17:33.590 --> 17:34.310
see demons?

17:34.790 --> 17:35.790
That's a good thing!

17:35.920 --> 17:37.550
What, did that Chi Wangchuan

17:38.100 --> 17:38.990
think she's pretty,

17:39.080 --> 17:39.730
like her,

17:39.750 --> 17:41.060
and give her his companion demon?

17:41.750 --> 17:42.880
You think being able to see death

17:42.880 --> 17:44.110
is some kind of gift?

17:44.440 --> 17:45.200
It's not?

17:48.640 --> 17:49.680
It's a curse.

17:55.310 --> 17:59.070
Then what should I do? I…

18:00.580 --> 18:01.980
Don't worry too much.

18:02.830 --> 18:04.640
The appearance of the white crow

18:04.640 --> 18:05.750
doesn't mean you'll die right away.

18:07.620 --> 18:08.710
How long do I have?

18:09.620 --> 18:11.240
Probably five or six days.

18:12.500 --> 18:13.460
Five or six days?

18:15.400 --> 18:17.310
Then maybe two or three days?

18:17.960 --> 18:19.110
Two or three days?

18:21.070 --> 18:22.790
How about just one or two days?

18:23.710 --> 18:25.180
One or two days?

18:26.930 --> 18:27.890
Stop yelling!

18:28.540 --> 18:29.060
I...

18:37.160 --> 18:37.830
Xuanye.

18:39.030 --> 18:40.160
Did you come up with something?

18:40.240 --> 18:41.880
I knew you'd have a way!

18:41.880 --> 18:42.550
I didn't stay friends with you

18:42.550 --> 18:43.070
all these years for nothing.

18:43.310 --> 18:43.830
Come on.

18:43.950 --> 18:44.610
Kill it.

18:44.640 --> 18:45.640
Kill it now. Come on.

18:47.330 --> 18:48.770
The white crow is a spirit.

18:48.910 --> 18:49.800
I can't kill it.

18:50.930 --> 18:52.300
And it's just an omen.

18:52.380 --> 18:53.580
Killing it won't

18:53.610 --> 18:54.650
solve anything.

18:56.790 --> 18:58.590
Then what should I do?

19:00.550 --> 19:01.440
I'll figure something out.

19:01.790 --> 19:02.610
Go home for now.

19:02.640 --> 19:03.070
I…

19:03.350 --> 19:04.030
I'm not leaving.

19:05.300 --> 19:06.820
If I'm gonna die, I'm dying right here with you.

19:07.480 --> 19:08.150
Wen Jian.

19:08.350 --> 19:09.110
Wen Jian.

19:11.600 --> 19:12.620
In the worst-case scenario,

19:13.230 --> 19:14.620
if my method doesn't work,

19:15.000 --> 19:16.350
you'll only have a day or two left to live.

19:17.000 --> 19:18.000
Don't you have anything

19:18.030 --> 19:19.350
you want to say to your family?

19:19.830 --> 19:20.550
I...

19:24.960 --> 19:25.240
I...

19:25.260 --> 19:25.780
Chi Xue.

19:28.440 --> 19:29.400
Escort Chief Constable Wen home.

19:30.550 --> 19:31.160
Chief Constable Wen.

19:31.510 --> 19:32.030
Let's go.

19:32.400 --> 19:33.750
No, no, I'm not leaving.

19:35.830 --> 19:36.510
Come on, let's go.

19:37.310 --> 19:37.830
I...

19:37.830 --> 19:39.510
Help… Help me out.

19:44.210 --> 19:45.060
You should go back too.

19:48.780 --> 19:49.690
About the white crow,

19:50.370 --> 19:51.610
don't worry about it for now.

19:52.760 --> 19:53.520
It's different

19:53.550 --> 19:54.710
from other demons.

19:54.930 --> 19:55.840
It won't harm you.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.920
If you see it again,

19:58.230 --> 19:59.230
just act like you don't.

19:59.750 --> 20:00.550
You'll be fine.

20:02.750 --> 20:03.310
Okay.

20:05.590 --> 20:06.790
I'll go back then.

20:23.830 --> 20:24.790
Don't sigh.

20:26.200 --> 20:27.060
Sighing won't help.

20:27.550 --> 20:28.510
If death's coming, it's coming.

20:29.590 --> 20:30.110
You…

20:40.550 --> 20:41.240
Honey.

20:42.920 --> 20:44.830
So you still remember to come home?

20:45.030 --> 20:46.510
Did you go gambling again?

20:46.590 --> 20:48.070
How much did you lose this time?

20:50.030 --> 20:51.400
Honey, don't worry,

20:51.400 --> 20:52.110
let me explain.

20:52.240 --> 20:52.830
I...

20:53.030 --> 20:54.880
I've heard enough of your excuses.

20:55.160 --> 20:56.950
Don't I know what you're like?

20:57.370 --> 20:58.650
I must've been blind to

20:58.680 --> 21:00.000
fall for a fat idiot like you.

21:00.350 --> 21:00.920
I...

21:02.880 --> 21:04.200
Chi Xue, help me explain.

21:09.750 --> 21:11.240
He really didn't go gambling.

21:12.000 --> 21:13.110
Then why didn't he come home?

21:13.870 --> 21:14.630
I don't know either.

21:15.480 --> 21:16.240
Maybe

21:17.420 --> 21:18.510
he's dying or something.

21:31.960 --> 21:32.880
Why are you staring at me?

21:33.550 --> 21:35.200
You're good at making up stories.

21:35.640 --> 21:36.270
Go ahead, keep lying.

21:37.400 --> 21:38.030
Honey,

21:39.640 --> 21:40.480
I'm dying.

21:41.400 --> 21:41.920
You...

21:43.790 --> 21:44.420
Don't worry.

21:45.240 --> 21:46.240
Let me finish what I'm saying.

21:46.950 --> 21:47.620
Fine.

21:48.350 --> 21:49.030
Go ahead.

21:49.450 --> 21:50.340
Keep talking.

21:50.750 --> 21:51.440
Speak.

21:54.310 --> 21:55.000
I was lying

21:55.000 --> 21:56.240
every time

21:56.480 --> 21:57.400
I told you I lost money.

21:58.750 --> 21:59.720
Come on, how clever I am.

22:00.200 --> 22:00.850
Of course I know

22:00.880 --> 22:02.160
that gambling leads to losses.

22:03.500 --> 22:04.700
I'm just fond of money

22:05.400 --> 22:06.920
and wanted to save some pocket money.

22:08.160 --> 22:09.030
I hid it

22:09.960 --> 22:10.750
all in the

22:11.000 --> 22:12.070
empty bricks of the outhouse.

22:16.790 --> 22:17.310
Honey,

22:19.000 --> 22:19.920
you're still young.

22:22.000 --> 22:22.750
After I die,

22:23.590 --> 22:24.790
find a good man to marry.

22:26.790 --> 22:27.680
Wen Jian,

22:32.880 --> 22:34.350
we're fine,

22:35.070 --> 22:36.000
it's no big deal

22:36.080 --> 22:37.450
if you lose a bit of money.

22:38.400 --> 22:39.680
Don't scare me.

22:39.960 --> 22:41.550
You know I'm easily frightened.

22:45.110 --> 22:46.960
Did something happen to you?

22:48.130 --> 22:49.280
Let's go find Lord Geng

22:49.310 --> 22:50.620
and have him help you.

22:52.750 --> 22:53.550
Lord Geng can't help me with

22:54.680 --> 22:56.000
this matter.

22:57.350 --> 22:59.160
Is someone seeking revenge?

23:00.920 --> 23:02.110
I can't explain it clearly right now,

23:03.400 --> 23:04.310
but anyway, this time

23:05.480 --> 23:06.550
there's no escaping.

23:32.720 --> 23:33.550
Changle Sword,

23:33.790 --> 23:35.070
born from following the cause and effect,

23:35.870 --> 23:37.720
has the power to sever the cause and break the past.

23:38.350 --> 23:39.240
When the time comes,

23:39.640 --> 23:41.350
the Changle Sword will appear on its own.

23:42.350 --> 23:42.960
However,

23:43.480 --> 23:44.550
opportunities are rare,

23:44.830 --> 23:46.160
and it cannot be forced.

23:47.380 --> 23:48.230
I'm back.

23:50.440 --> 23:51.400
Was your journey safe?

23:51.720 --> 23:52.400
It was safe,

23:53.590 --> 23:55.110
but once we get home, it's another story.

23:55.750 --> 23:56.750
His wife says she wants to

23:56.780 --> 23:57.780
give him a serious scolding.

23:58.000 --> 23:59.130
I think she's quite serious about it.

24:05.880 --> 24:06.900
Are you planning to

24:07.340 --> 24:08.940
use the Changle Sword to save Wen Jian?

24:13.350 --> 24:14.680
Unfortunately, the time for the cause and effect hasn't come yet.

24:15.830 --> 24:17.590
It still refuses to show itself.

25:30.680 --> 25:31.930
It's actually true.

26:33.180 --> 26:36.030
[Reunion Inn]

27:03.950 --> 27:06.220
Are you here to stay

27:07.310 --> 27:08.310
or to rob?

27:09.550 --> 27:10.310
I'm here to stay.

27:29.750 --> 27:31.720
Are you alone?

27:32.590 --> 27:33.160
Yes.

27:33.650 --> 27:35.830
[Zhou Wuniang]

27:34.270 --> 27:35.930
How should I address you, sir?

27:40.000 --> 27:40.720
My surname is Duan.

27:44.400 --> 27:45.310
Mr. Duan,

27:46.750 --> 27:48.030
where are you from

27:48.980 --> 27:50.160
and where are you going?

27:56.590 --> 27:58.440
Mr. Duan, if you don't show the travel permit,

27:58.920 --> 28:01.310
we

28:01.750 --> 28:02.480
won't be able to explain it

28:04.510 --> 28:05.590
if the officials come to inquire.

28:07.970 --> 28:09.010
It's my oversight.

28:17.060 --> 28:19.750
May I ask

28:20.110 --> 28:20.780
where the innkeeper is?

28:21.240 --> 28:22.440
The innkeeper is my father,

28:25.070 --> 28:25.920
in the back courtyard.

28:32.550 --> 28:33.270
Are you from

28:34.620 --> 28:35.660
an official family?

28:38.580 --> 28:40.380
Could you give me a room first?

28:48.000 --> 28:49.640
The hot springs at our inn

28:50.750 --> 28:51.720
are the most famous.

28:52.460 --> 28:53.170
How about

28:53.840 --> 28:56.160
I take you to a hot spring bath later?

28:56.760 --> 28:57.320
No need.

28:57.880 --> 28:59.000
Just prepare some food and wine.

29:01.440 --> 29:02.200
Alright.

29:02.990 --> 29:04.100
Your inn

29:05.140 --> 29:06.230
is really quiet.

29:07.300 --> 29:09.780
My father is renovating the inn,

29:10.200 --> 29:12.070
so we've not been

29:14.230 --> 29:15.140
taking in guests recently.

29:15.470 --> 29:16.710
Am I the only guest here?

29:17.350 --> 29:18.160
Yes,

29:18.900 --> 29:21.620
we can't turn you away.

29:21.960 --> 29:24.200
It's not safe

29:24.680 --> 29:26.240
for someone to sleep outdoors

29:26.790 --> 29:27.920
in this desolate wilderness.

29:31.970 --> 29:33.080
Your inn

29:33.110 --> 29:34.400
is so complicatedly built.

29:35.070 --> 29:36.240
Aren't you afraid guests will get lost?

29:37.640 --> 29:39.000
We have many

29:39.350 --> 29:40.240
attendants here.

29:40.860 --> 29:42.820
No matter where you are,

29:43.240 --> 29:44.680
as long as you call out,

29:45.110 --> 29:47.000
someone will hear you.

29:47.240 --> 29:48.200
So naturally,

29:49.310 --> 29:50.590
there's no worry about getting lost.

29:51.790 --> 29:52.700
-Wuniang.
-Wuniang.

29:53.720 --> 29:54.350
You,

29:54.880 --> 29:56.480
go prepare some food and wine

29:56.750 --> 29:57.850
for this young master

29:58.200 --> 30:00.480
and send it to the courtyard in front.

30:01.170 --> 30:01.930
Yes.

30:14.590 --> 30:15.350
What are you doing?

30:17.070 --> 30:18.830
I noticed that your complexion

30:18.830 --> 30:20.400
doesn't seem very good.

30:21.110 --> 30:23.550
It would be best if you stayed a little longer

30:23.760 --> 30:25.480
to rest and recover before continuing your journey.

30:26.880 --> 30:27.830
I still have business to attend to.

30:28.270 --> 30:29.110
I'll stay for one night and leave.

30:30.240 --> 30:32.110
Just staying for one night?

30:35.310 --> 30:36.400
My father said that

30:36.740 --> 30:38.020
meeting is fate.

30:40.910 --> 30:42.030
It's really a pity.

30:46.950 --> 30:47.670
Mr. Duan,

30:48.200 --> 30:49.550
your room is just ahead.

31:13.430 --> 31:15.630
This is our house-made wine,

31:16.240 --> 31:17.460
clear, sweet,

31:17.830 --> 31:18.880
and with a lingering aftertaste.

31:20.000 --> 31:20.720
Please,

31:21.680 --> 31:23.260
have a taste.

31:24.790 --> 31:25.720
Thank you, Miss Zhou.

31:28.380 --> 31:29.790
I'll take my leave now.

32:16.480 --> 32:17.480
Is anyone here?

32:19.480 --> 32:20.510
Boss!

32:21.880 --> 32:23.110
Boss!

32:37.540 --> 32:39.870
♫Torturous lovesickness♫

32:39.900 --> 32:43.370
♫Yet mutual confession is even harder♫

32:44.310 --> 32:50.280
♫Drifting like a willow in the wind, yearning for a good ending♫

32:50.710 --> 32:56.370
♫Side by side, we share a gaze too deep for words♫

32:56.520 --> 33:03.130
♫Keep silent with no regrets♫

33:03.290 --> 33:09.660
♫Share days and nights with you♫

33:09.950 --> 33:16.090
♫In exchange for a lifelong deep love♫

33:12.110 --> 33:13.000
Manniang!

33:16.320 --> 33:19.600
♫Entwined through the endless night♫

33:19.830 --> 33:22.640
♫Blossoms fell into eternal sleep in a blink♫

33:20.960 --> 33:21.920
Manniang!

33:22.670 --> 33:29.010
♫With no regrets, only joy in this life♫

33:30.240 --> 33:32.570
♫Torturous lovesickness♫

33:32.600 --> 33:36.070
♫Yet mutual confession is even harder♫

33:37.010 --> 33:42.980
♫Drifting like a willow in the wind, yearning for a good ending♫

33:43.410 --> 33:49.070
♫Side by side, we share a gaze too deep for words♫

33:49.220 --> 33:55.830
♫Keep silent with no regrets♫

33:55.990 --> 34:02.360
♫Share days and nights with you♫

34:02.650 --> 34:08.790
♫In exchange for a lifelong deep love♫

34:09.020 --> 34:12.300
♫Entwined through the endless night♫

34:12.530 --> 34:15.340
♫Blossoms fell into eternal sleep in a blink♫

34:15.370 --> 34:21.710
♫With no regrets, only joy in this life♫

34:33.110 --> 34:34.280
Bet here! Bet here! Bet here!

34:34.670 --> 34:35.070
Listen to me!

34:35.070 --> 34:35.710
Bet here! Bet here!

34:40.800 --> 34:41.510
Chief Constable Chu,

34:42.030 --> 34:43.880
what brings you here?

34:45.920 --> 34:46.710
An ill wind.

34:52.030 --> 34:52.630
Come on, come on!

34:52.630 --> 34:53.800
Next round, hurry!

34:57.320 --> 34:58.040
Where are you running to?

35:00.310 --> 35:01.470
Guangping Residence.

35:03.260 --> 35:04.180
It's fine, it's fine.

35:04.210 --> 35:05.290
Don't run!

35:08.670 --> 35:09.230
Don't move!

35:10.960 --> 35:11.630
Where's Gao Sheng?

35:12.110 --> 35:12.510
He...

35:13.330 --> 35:14.460
Didn't he die?

35:14.630 --> 35:15.440
Dead?

35:16.030 --> 35:16.510
Yes.

35:16.590 --> 35:17.400
He's dead.

35:18.570 --> 35:19.780
But I heard that just two days ago,

35:19.810 --> 35:20.810
you were drinking with someone

35:21.190 --> 35:22.510
and said Gao Sheng came back to life,

35:22.510 --> 35:23.670
even toasting with you.

35:24.230 --> 35:25.710
How is it that he's dead again now?

35:26.320 --> 35:27.750
I was talking nonsense after drinking.

35:28.030 --> 35:29.190
How can that be taken seriously?

35:31.320 --> 35:31.880
No, no, no!

35:31.880 --> 35:32.760
Are you going to tell me or not?

35:32.800 --> 35:33.880
I'll tell you.

35:35.070 --> 35:36.360
I really thought he was dead.

35:36.710 --> 35:37.620
When I saw him again,

35:37.840 --> 35:38.590
I was shocked.

35:39.480 --> 35:40.710
He only told me while drinking that

35:40.960 --> 35:42.290
his mother used some tricks

35:42.400 --> 35:43.360
to help him escape death.

35:43.960 --> 35:44.840
Where is he now?

35:49.000 --> 35:49.440
He's...

35:49.710 --> 35:50.670
He's at a relative's place in the mountains,

35:50.670 --> 35:51.400
laying low to avoid trouble.

36:17.150 --> 36:17.840
You're here.

36:27.710 --> 36:29.190
You didn't sleep all night?

36:30.490 --> 36:31.930
Have you found any solution?

36:38.280 --> 36:39.510
Let's go to Wen Jian's house first.

36:40.510 --> 36:41.280
Wait for me a moment.

36:50.670 --> 36:53.480
There are often signs of misfortune, spreading the news of death.

37:05.150 --> 37:05.800
Let's go.

37:06.710 --> 37:07.360
Alright.

37:14.280 --> 37:15.880
Wen Jian, wake up!

37:19.110 --> 37:19.920
Where is he?

37:55.670 --> 37:56.510
Go; up.

37:59.360 --> 38:00.040
Careful.

38:04.280 --> 38:05.420
A bit higher.

38:05.960 --> 38:06.720
Higher.

38:06.800 --> 38:07.280
That's right.

38:08.030 --> 38:10.110
To the left. It's tilted. Left.

38:10.510 --> 38:10.960
Left!

38:12.900 --> 38:13.810
Don't stand here gawking!

38:13.840 --> 38:14.760
Move along quickly!

38:15.960 --> 38:17.290
Isn't that Chief Constable Wen?

38:23.510 --> 38:24.360
Someone's been hit!

38:50.550 --> 38:51.320
Ms. Wen,

38:51.880 --> 38:53.550
just now a few constables came to the door

38:53.880 --> 38:55.320
saying that Lord Geng from the government office

38:55.320 --> 38:56.000
will be here soon.

38:56.590 --> 38:57.190
Also,

38:57.530 --> 38:59.150
the coffin from Su's Coffin Shop

38:59.480 --> 39:00.480
will be here shortly.

39:00.940 --> 39:02.280
You see,

39:02.630 --> 39:03.630
are we going to carry it in now?

39:04.360 --> 39:05.110
Why?

39:06.550 --> 39:08.000
Why did this happen?

39:16.320 --> 39:17.360
Ms. Wen.

39:27.510 --> 39:28.190
Physician Jiu,

39:28.670 --> 39:30.630
Ms. Wen has fainted from crying.

39:31.050 --> 39:31.810
You and Wen Jian

39:31.920 --> 39:32.920
have always been on good terms,

39:33.510 --> 39:34.190
so why don't you

39:34.760 --> 39:35.960
give her some advice?

39:37.190 --> 39:38.590
Why did this happen?

39:43.240 --> 39:43.930
What's going on?

39:43.950 --> 39:45.510
Why all this commotion so early in the morning?

39:50.740 --> 39:51.350
Wen Jian?

39:51.800 --> 39:52.710
Wen Jian,

39:53.110 --> 39:54.230
you're not dead?

39:54.400 --> 39:54.880
What's wrong?

39:55.650 --> 39:56.520
-Honey.
-You're not dead?

39:56.550 --> 39:57.440
What's wrong, honey?

40:01.380 --> 40:02.420
Honey.

40:02.480 --> 40:03.440
You...

40:03.710 --> 40:04.510
You dressed like this.

40:04.960 --> 40:05.710
Our family...

40:06.070 --> 40:08.270
I knew you couldn't die.

40:08.960 --> 40:09.550
Honey.

40:13.480 --> 40:14.190
Honey.

40:31.630 --> 40:32.560
Today, on the street,

40:32.880 --> 40:33.630
we saw someone

40:33.630 --> 40:35.190
who looked exactly like you

40:35.400 --> 40:36.510
get crushed by a signboard.

40:37.330 --> 40:38.760
We all thought that person was you,

40:39.150 --> 40:40.480
so we arranged a funeral for you.

40:41.070 --> 40:41.510
Well...

40:42.660 --> 40:44.950
Looked exactly like me?

40:45.920 --> 40:47.250
What's going on with you?

40:47.280 --> 40:48.030
Where have you been?

40:48.670 --> 40:49.230
I...

40:49.440 --> 40:51.110
I've been sleeping all along.

40:51.550 --> 40:52.710
I just woke up

40:52.710 --> 40:53.630
under the bed

40:53.710 --> 40:54.510
and then heard all

40:54.510 --> 40:55.440
the noise outside,

40:55.440 --> 40:56.400
so I came out.

40:59.160 --> 41:00.160
Ban... Banxia,

41:00.550 --> 41:01.110
that...

41:01.920 --> 41:03.640
Is that Master Crow

41:03.670 --> 41:04.280
still around?

41:05.710 --> 41:06.440
No.

41:07.060 --> 41:07.830
He flew away

41:07.850 --> 41:09.120
when the signboard fell and killed him

41:09.150 --> 41:10.190
on the street.

41:12.360 --> 41:13.800
Is there really such a lucky turn of events?

41:14.700 --> 41:16.070
Someone who looked exactly like me

41:16.230 --> 41:16.840
died,

41:17.070 --> 41:18.070
and I'm fine?

41:20.710 --> 41:21.880
Do you know

41:21.900 --> 41:22.690
the black cat at the memorial hall?

41:23.270 --> 41:23.840
I...

41:24.190 --> 41:26.120
How would I know a cat?

41:31.150 --> 41:31.790
Ms. Wen,

41:32.610 --> 41:33.580
do you know it?

41:34.550 --> 41:35.270
I...

41:35.320 --> 41:36.030
Honey.

41:41.290 --> 41:43.730
This matter is very likely connected to a demon.

41:44.530 --> 41:45.370
Though Wen Jian

41:45.490 --> 41:46.690
has luckily escaped death,

41:47.150 --> 41:47.960
we have no idea

41:47.980 --> 41:49.240
whether this demon

41:49.420 --> 41:50.540
is a blessing or a curse.

41:51.190 --> 41:52.280
Ms. Wen, we hope that

41:52.360 --> 41:53.480
you can be honest with us

41:53.900 --> 41:55.250
so we can make plans early.

41:55.630 --> 41:56.110
Well...

41:56.940 --> 41:58.170
That day, Wen Jian came back

41:58.200 --> 42:00.450
and talked a lot about life and death,

42:01.360 --> 42:02.840
even telling me

42:02.840 --> 42:03.710
where he hid his private money.

42:04.190 --> 42:05.560
I was scared, couldn't sleep,

42:05.960 --> 42:07.150
so I went to the place

42:07.150 --> 42:08.070
he mentioned.

42:09.190 --> 42:09.840
Suddenly,

42:10.030 --> 42:11.480
I heard a cat meow.

42:11.670 --> 42:12.630
When I turned around,

42:12.760 --> 42:14.840
I saw a cat sitting on the wall.

42:17.710 --> 42:18.840
Is that the same cat

42:18.840 --> 42:19.590
from the funeral hall?

42:21.110 --> 42:22.030
The night was too dark,

42:22.360 --> 42:23.630
so I couldn't see clearly.

42:25.000 --> 42:27.070
But that cat gave off

42:27.760 --> 42:28.840
a very strange feeling.

42:29.480 --> 42:30.850
I immediately thought of

42:30.880 --> 42:31.760
the rumors about

42:31.920 --> 42:33.550
the Cat Demon exchanging lives.

42:33.710 --> 42:35.440
Then I remembered what Wen Jian had said,

42:36.320 --> 42:37.520
and I got really anxious.

42:37.540 --> 42:38.730
Feeling desperate, I decided to try anything

42:38.760 --> 42:40.440
and gave all the money to that cat,

42:40.710 --> 42:41.960
hoping it would help Wen Jian

42:42.230 --> 42:43.280
escape this crisis.

42:43.630 --> 42:44.360
I didn't expect

42:44.630 --> 42:45.820
it to really work.

42:46.550 --> 42:47.220
Honey.

42:49.400 --> 42:50.920
The Cat Demon that exchanges lives?

42:51.620 --> 42:52.110
Yes.

42:52.390 --> 42:53.950
It's called the Nine Lives Immortal.

42:54.280 --> 42:55.630
They say that if you give it money,

42:55.810 --> 42:56.970
it can exchange lives for you,

42:57.000 --> 42:58.010
taking death in your place.

42:59.420 --> 43:00.210
The life-exchanging demon.

43:01.160 --> 43:02.490
Is it that life-exchanging demon?

43:03.800 --> 43:04.480
Ms. Wen,

43:04.750 --> 43:06.000
do you know

43:06.020 --> 43:06.770
how to summon this

43:06.800 --> 43:07.930
life-exchanging demon?

43:10.440 --> 43:12.150
I've secretly inquired about it.

43:12.590 --> 43:14.150
They say you need to go out alone

43:14.230 --> 43:15.280
at the hour of 11PM,

43:15.840 --> 43:17.000
turn left at

43:17.000 --> 43:18.400
the first intersection,

43:18.540 --> 43:19.250
stop at

43:19.270 --> 43:20.480
the seventh intersection,

43:20.920 --> 43:21.710
and

43:22.370 --> 43:24.040
along the way, you must never look back.

43:31.580 --> 43:32.390
Why is Banxia

43:32.420 --> 43:33.210
taking so long?

43:33.880 --> 43:35.000
Could something have gone wrong?

43:39.480 --> 43:41.230
I am Banxia,

43:41.670 --> 43:43.110
sincerely praying,

43:43.630 --> 43:46.800
humbly asking the Nine Lives Immortal to appear.

43:47.150 --> 43:50.190
I am Banxia, sincerely praying

44:08.550 --> 44:09.840
to the Nine Lives Immortal.

44:13.140 --> 44:14.680
My name is Duan Banxia,

44:14.820 --> 44:17.140
and my father is Duan Yingheng.

44:18.160 --> 44:19.050
I have something

44:19.080 --> 44:20.850
to ask the Nine Lives Immortal.

44:26.000 --> 44:27.160
A month ago,

44:27.880 --> 44:29.630
in Penglai Alley of Nanyang City,

44:29.660 --> 44:31.100
the third house from the left

44:31.280 --> 44:32.580
caught on fire.

44:33.550 --> 44:35.880
I want to know if my father borrowed a life from you

44:36.630 --> 44:38.670
during the fire, faking his death

44:38.920 --> 44:40.630
to escape the capture of the Mirror Demon.

44:44.450 --> 44:45.530
Nine Lives Immortal!

44:46.510 --> 44:47.150
Banxia!

44:50.550 --> 44:51.280
Xuanye,

44:51.710 --> 44:53.320
I just saw Nine Lives Immortal.
